{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116514459099537409"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T13:07:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116517402825601094"], "id": "2116517402825601094", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 662, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "😤 Claude 敢不敢跟！X 新订阅全面支持支付宝！\n\n这意味着你能直接订阅现在体验最顶级的 Personal Agent —— Grok Bot！\n\n开通了之后不知道怎么用？快来 Grok Bot 学习站 ⬇️\nhttps://t.co/NQ6xSSjC5l\n\n而且还包含了 X 蓝 V，支付宝开通蓝 V 详细还是有些魔幻色彩 🤔 https://t.co/336ZAWI9qp", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116517402825601094"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T09:56:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116469283853340902"], "id": "2116469283853340902", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1083, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116463799049850948", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🥹 我一直想回报黄啊码老师，去年加了万象 AI 实验室的付费社群，黄啊码一直在交付内容，定时定期上课，分享新技术。我自己开始分享内容，做实战营教练的时候，黄啊码还特地给我指导培训开小灶，告诉我应该怎么讲更好\n\n最近黄啊码也来 X https://t.co/ZblMuKSBoI", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116469283853340902"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116345385849704449", "3_2116345385849683968", "3_2116345385849671680", "13_2116345385870639104"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:44:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116345449359777974"], "id": "2116345449359777974", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3166, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "小舅子乔迁我要送个电视，不知道怎么挑，直接让 Bot 帮我去挑了\n\n中间还偷看它干活来着，有时候确实解放双手\n\n-5500😭 https://t.co/2HIo3VTkOH", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116345449359777974"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116331734983950336", "3_2116331735004905472"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:49:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116331745050337708"], "id": "2116331745050337708", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1714, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🌚啊？都检查一下 Grok @bot 的定时任务！我就说早上小铁柱怎么没往群里发日报总结呢\n\n原来它给自己定时是只在工作日上班，好家伙，我都单双休你凭什么双休，起来干活！😡 https://t.co/dwPCAs5XzF", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116331745050337708"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116200595145236480"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:32:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116327290816860562"], "id": "2116327290816860562", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 987, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "😤 冲！报名了乐奇的全球开发大赛，希望可以通过审核。我要让 Grok Bot 进入眼镜中！ https://t.co/kjTM4ETbc8", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116327290816860562"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116316489863385088"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T23:49:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116316496985313626"], "id": "2116316496985313626", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1041, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116256600436641887", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🤣达里奥你好，你的好友 Tibo 邀请你一起参加 28 天重置挑战，哈哈哈哈哈\n\n还骄傲起来了，哈哈哈哈哈 https://t.co/j65AOhoyNv https://t.co/pD1FqeFzlM", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116316496985313626"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116201479791116289"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:24:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116204610679648647"], "id": "2116204610679648647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1390, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "😊 嘿嘿，被我非常喜欢的 @CuiMao 老师关注了，朋友提醒我才发现的，被老师的达里奥系列狠狠圈粉了！ https://t.co/vbsIMLQDuW", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116204610679648647"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T16:05:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116199797153743177"], "id": "2116199797153743177", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 965, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116162787873583462", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🎉 Grok Bot Meetup 郑州和南京的线下活动来了！\n欢迎报名呀！ https://t.co/5fNkHPd8y4", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116199797153743177"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116168952074412032"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T14:03:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116169095146246422"], "id": "2116169095146246422", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2686, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "⚠️ 警告警告警告！不要在 Grok @bot 里面去接入 Claude Code 了。现在 Grok bot 的 IP 不稳定，除非你自己搞个家宽接在 Grok bot 上面\n\n如果这样做的话，其实和自己在本地使用是没有区别的，体验可能还比放在 Grokbot 上面更好\n\n之前这个方法能用，是因为 Grok bot 的 IP https://t.co/UqHffsgx2i", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116169095146246422"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116148963581771776"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:44:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116149130091528521"], "id": "2116149130091528521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 54, "impression_count": 6244, "like_count": 50, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "🤔 都用错了！我发现之前很多 Grok @bot 的用法是错的，很多能力建议做成全局可被调用的 skills 而不是单独创建一个 Bot\n\n因为这样是有点脱裤子放屁的，A2A 有信息传递的损耗以及增加了 Bot 的额度消耗\n\n比如一个 Muse2API 的服务，不需要通过一个 Bot 去调用，而是配置完之后让其他 Bot https://t.co/B5M2kAlQbv", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116149130091528521"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116067987321233408"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T07:23:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116068457200726171"], "id": "2116068457200726171", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2249, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🎃 太可爱了！Grok @bot 官方万圣节彩蛋！🥚\n\n南瓜头像 🎃 只支持橙色，非常可爱，不知道万圣节过去还会不会保留～\n\n感觉官方后面会增加更多的头像联动，自己也能创作动画头像就好了 https://t.co/WFSu2L1Ehk", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116068457200726171"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116043181683011585"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T05:46:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116043968605774138"], "id": "2116043968605774138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 84, "impression_count": 13424, "like_count": 80, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 22, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "👀 洗洗眼睛！Grok @bot 的 Pages 功能是真的好用啊，天天看 Markdown 真的看腻了。Pages 有数据有图表，有样式，点开卡片就能看，太方便了！\n\n让学习站 Bot 每天给我刷新访问量、SEO 情况的 Pages ，点开就能看到数据和趋势，真的有种一切尽在掌握的感觉！\n\n这个案例也收录到 Grok Bot https://t.co/zRg0q4tICF", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116043968605774138"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T05:05:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116033750018785396"], "id": "2116033750018785396", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1536, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115993170823794720", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "我开发一个插件来过滤掉所有“卧槽”怎么样\n\n第一刀先砍自己，我就是卧槽体代表人！ https://t.co/ilfbaXoGYV", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116033750018785396"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T17:29:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115857927533940906", "2115858567656017967"], "id": "2115858567656017967", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2833, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115850175868727621", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🤣总算等来 28 天挑战唯一有作用的改进，Pro 用量全面翻倍，5x 要起飞了！\n\n这招我在双十一见过，先涨价后降价，让你感觉赚到了，其实啥也没变，不过确实 5x 有提升\n\n前面的重置和发布的内容还不如咬打火机更有节目效果 https://t.co/GZVf61nfM6", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115858567656017967"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115832964080910336"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:48:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115833047983771722"], "id": "2115833047983771722", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1087, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "小茂密怎么这个点还不睡啊？ https://t.co/N6Iu7YCKbu", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115833047983771722"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115821661442523136", "3_2115821661605998592"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:04:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115822025763930353"], "id": "2115822025763930353", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2280, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115722202712789476", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok @bot 无处不在！想要试用的同学主页找我～ https://t.co/KFzM2sCzDf https://t.co/drJXRYMQGZ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115822025763930353"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115815193666310144"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:37:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115815391167652001"], "id": "2115815391167652001", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 43, "impression_count": 13344, "like_count": 54, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115722202712789476", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "有没有想要这个功能的？微信聊天记录直接转发给指定的 Bot？ https://t.co/VcCWnLZpQf https://t.co/drJXRYMQGZ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115815391167652001"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115752943093764097", "3_2115752945589358592"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T10:29:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115752949276123606"], "id": "2115752949276123606", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 4317, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🎉 Grok @bot 迎来 v0.78.1，这次合并了 0.75 到 0.78 的内容，把购物卡、Pages 和 Vault 一起推了上来。\n\n1️⃣ 购物卡：商品结果带图带分带价格，支持横滑查看，下单前必须你确认\n2️⃣ 物流进度：买完自动跟进快递，发货派送都会给通知\n3️⃣ https://t.co/xPk2pKr2I5", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115752949276123606"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T10:11:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115748365191569414"], "id": "2115748365191569414", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 2835, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115715262163091499", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🤓 看完思路打开了，政策新闻永远是风向标，冬青老师这个 Bot 帮你发掘隐藏的商机！单单卖虚拟资料就是很大的一个机会了，这个 Bot 我直接收录到 Grok Bot 学习站的 Bot 直聘 板块了，大家可以导入直接使用！ https://t.co/3CSgh1hjwv", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115748365191569414"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T08:59:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115730105733640206"], "id": "2115730105733640206", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 1694, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115693826920898722", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🥳 太棒了，给任意 Agent 装上 Renoise MCP 就能摸到接近 Opus 5.5 的成片水位，一句话做出约 30 秒成片，模型差距直接被插件拉平了。用不上 5.5 的同学机会来了，有了这个拼的就是自己的网感和表达。\n\nvibe 知识大赏起号就是现在，别在起跑线上空想了！ https://t.co/1bglKecPny", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115730105733640206"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115716124268802049"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T08:27:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115722202712789476"], "id": "2115722202712789476", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 102, "impression_count": 27703, "like_count": 113, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 53, "retweet_count": 10}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111494899493413005", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "😎 整了个大活儿 ！Grok @bot 终于能被别的 Agent 指挥了。\n\n我在 Codex 里说了一句话，它就列出了我账号下的所有 Bot，我可以和每个 Bot 单独沟通派活，回收结果！\n\n现在能做到：\n\n1️⃣ 多个 Grok Bot 账号连成网，Bot 跨账号互相派活，队伍随便扩\n\n2️⃣ 给 Grok Bot 换个大脑：Claude、GPT https://t.co/rCSPVSPhwA https://t.co/FHt0meun24", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115722202712789476"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T07:41:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115710508011794916"], "id": "2115710508011794916", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 916, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115464885887000877", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "😳 啊？我就是一个啊？iOS 直接开源算了，你拦不住破限  AI + REA 了！我看这根线很眼熟， @jlxc2001 你是不是还有一台一加手机？一加 5T 有没有刷成 iOS 的可能 https://t.co/KH6C5PbBI0", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115710508011794916"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115661253918277632"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:32:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115693111821173230"], "id": "2115693111821173230", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1290, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115444213169242492", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🥰 太甜了！Grok @bot 你也磕 CP 吗？我看杰哥昨天截流 @thsottiaux Tibo 重置时间的帖子流量很好，我想安排个 Bot 盯着 Tibo 的重置预告帖子，自动发转换+给 Grok Bot 学习站打广告\n\n结果给我创建了一个盯梢的 Bot，说会盯着 @poteto 发的重置贴，所以你们俩是已经好成一个人了吗? https://t.co/RMmWP4XRcQ https://t.co/OrkHcV5LIw", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115693111821173230"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115679853198610432"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T05:40:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115680065992454578"], "id": "2115680065992454578", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1686, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114883723930030505", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🥹 被自己感动了，只有我关心小铁柱每天早上 8 点同时做三个群的日报压力大不大（虽然是我安排的活儿） https://t.co/h4ScdWlioC https://t.co/hKiPUqlZfx", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115680065992454578"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2116514459099537409", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116345385849704449", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116345385849683968", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116345385849671680", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2116345385870639104", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2116331734983950336", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116331735004905472", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116200595145236480", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116316489863385088", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116201479791116289", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116168952074412032", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116148963581771776", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2116067987321233408", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2116043181683011585", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2115832964080910336", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2115821661442523136", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115821661605998592", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115815193666310144", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115752943093764097", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115752945589358592", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2115716124268802049", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2115661253918277632", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115679853198610432", "type": "photo"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2116517402825601094", "next_token": "7140dibdnow9c7btwp0g784urcuzf1by15vg9jmq8n1h4", "oldest_id": "2115680065992454578", "result_count": 24}}